WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.573
I light the memory of an evening: 12 November 1884.

00:00:05.873 --> 00:00:12.769
That was when Timișoara’s electric street lighting opened, with 731 lamps.

00:00:13.069 --> 00:00:18.851
I am not an original lamp, but a reminder of how light changed the city’s streets.
